{"id":"4f8d035bfd71a4ab","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-letterless-trace.md","title":"Rank Trace and Effective Finite-Cofinite Codes","display":"df-letterless-trace — Rank Trace and Effective Finite-Cofinite Codes","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-letterless-trace","aliases":["89-df-letterless-trace"],"display":"df-letterless-trace — Rank Trace and Effective Finite-Cofinite Codes","depends_on":["[[89-df-letterless-formula]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-letterless-trace"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-letterless-trace</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-letterless-trace — Rank Trace and Effective Finite-Cofinite Codes"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5d3ed6dcac828731\" href=\"?note=5d3ed6dcac828731\" title=\"89-df-letterless-formula\">89-df-letterless-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathrm{LL}_{\\Box}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathrm{LL}_{\\Box}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{tr}:\\mathrm{LL}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)\">\\(\\mathrm{tr}:\\mathrm{LL}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\)</span> 为下文定义的迹。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{FC}\">\\(\\mathsf{FC}\\)</span> 为下文引入的有限/余有限码，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{den}\">\\(\\operatorname{den}\\)</span> 为其集合解释，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg_c,\\cap_c,\\Box_c\">\\(\\neg_c,\\cap_c,\\Box_c\\)</span> 为码运算。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{tc}:\\mathrm{LL}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathsf{FC}\">\\(\\mathrm{tc}:\\mathrm{LL}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathsf{FC}\\)</span> 是下文同步定义的有效迹码。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> 的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{FC}\\setminus\\{(1,\\varnothing)\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{FC}\\setminus\\{(1,\\varnothing)\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_c\">\\(\\Box_c\\)</span> 在其余单独分支不调用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}letterless\\text{-}trace}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{tr}(\\bot)&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,&amp;\\mathrm{tr}(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\omega\\setminus\\mathrm{tr}(A),\\\\\n\\mathrm{tr}(A\\land B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{tr}(A)\\cap\\mathrm{tr}(B),&amp;\n\\mathrm{tr}(\\Box A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{n\\in\\omega\\mid\\forall j&lt;n\\;j\\in\\mathrm{tr}(A)\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{FC}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(e,E)\\mid e\\in\\{0,1\\},\\ E\\subseteq\\omega,\\ \\exists m\\in\\omega\\ E\\subseteq m\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{den}(e,E)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}E,&amp;e=0,\\\\\\omega\\setminus E,&amp;e=1,\\end{cases}\n&amp;\\neg_c(e,E)&amp;\\coloneqq(1-e,E),\\\\\n(e,E)\\cap_c(f,D)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}(0,E\\cap D),&amp;(e,f)=(0,0),\\\\(0,E\\setminus D),&amp;(e,f)=(0,1),\\\\\n(0,D\\setminus E),&amp;(e,f)=(1,0),\\\\(1,E\\cup D),&amp;(e,f)=(1,1),\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mu(e,E)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\min(\\omega\\setminus E),&amp;e=0,\\\\\\min E,&amp;e=1\\land E\\ne\\varnothing,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\Box_c(e,E)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}(1,\\varnothing),&amp;(e,E)=(1,\\varnothing),\\\\\n(0,\\{0,\\ldots,\\mu(e,E)\\}),&amp;(e,E)\\ne(1,\\varnothing),\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{tc}(\\bot)&amp;\\coloneqq(0,\\varnothing),&amp;\\mathrm{tc}(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg_c\\mathrm{tc}(A),\\\\\n\\mathrm{tc}(A\\land B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{tc}(A)\\cap_c\\mathrm{tc}(B),&amp;\n\\mathrm{tc}(\\Box A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\Box_c\\mathrm{tc}(A).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}letterless\\text{-}trace}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{tr}(\\bot)&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,&amp;\\mathrm{tr}(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\omega\\setminus\\mathrm{tr}(A),\\\\\n\\mathrm{tr}(A\\land B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{tr}(A)\\cap\\mathrm{tr}(B),&amp;\n\\mathrm{tr}(\\Box A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{n\\in\\omega\\mid\\forall j&lt;n\\;j\\in\\mathrm{tr}(A)\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{FC}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(e,E)\\mid e\\in\\{0,1\\},\\ E\\subseteq\\omega,\\ \\exists m\\in\\omega\\ E\\subseteq m\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{den}(e,E)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}E,&amp;e=0,\\\\\\omega\\setminus E,&amp;e=1,\\end{cases}\n&amp;\\neg_c(e,E)&amp;\\coloneqq(1-e,E),\\\\\n(e,E)\\cap_c(f,D)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}(0,E\\cap D),&amp;(e,f)=(0,0),\\\\(0,E\\setminus D),&amp;(e,f)=(0,1),\\\\\n(0,D\\setminus E),&amp;(e,f)=(1,0),\\\\(1,E\\cup D),&amp;(e,f)=(1,1),\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mu(e,E)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\min(\\omega\\setminus E),&amp;e=0,\\\\\\min E,&amp;e=1\\land E\\ne\\varnothing,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\Box_c(e,E)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}(1,\\varnothing),&amp;(e,E)=(1,\\varnothing),\\\\\n(0,\\{0,\\ldots,\\mu(e,E)\\}),&amp;(e,E)\\ne(1,\\varnothing),\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{tc}(\\bot)&amp;\\coloneqq(0,\\varnothing),&amp;\\mathrm{tc}(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg_c\\mathrm{tc}(A),\\\\\n\\mathrm{tc}(A\\land B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{tc}(A)\\cap_c\\mathrm{tc}(B),&amp;\n\\mathrm{tc}(\\Box A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\Box_c\\mathrm{tc}(A).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 95–96；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>保留原来的全部集合迹条款，增加可计算码。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e=0\">\\(e=0\\)</span> 表示有限集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e=1\">\\(e=1\\)</span> 表示余有限集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 总是有限且唯一。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> 只在非满迹码上定义，盒运算在满迹码上先返回 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(1,\\varnothing)\">\\((1,\\varnothing)\\)</span>，不会对空集合取最小值。有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 的最小缺失自然数存在，并可在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,\\ldots,|E|\">\\(0,\\ldots,|E|\\)</span> 内找到。\n盒的输出初段必须包含最小缺失秩本身：该秩 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 只检查 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;k\">\\(j&lt;k\\)</span>；到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k+1\">\\(k+1\\)</span> 才失败。空输入因此得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0\\}\">\\(\\{0\\}\\)</span>，满输入仍满。形式化递归只沿公式树下降，有限码运算没有未声明的无限搜索。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-letterless-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5d3ed6dcac828731","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-letterless-formula]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathrm{LL}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{tr}:\\mathrm{LL}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{FC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{den}","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg_c,\\cap_c,\\Box_c","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{tc}:\\mathrm{LL}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathsf{FC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{FC}\\setminus\\{(1,\\varnothing)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box_c","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}letterless\\text{-}trace}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{tr}(\\bot)&\\coloneqq\\varnothing,&\\mathrm{tr}(\\neg A)&\\coloneqq\\omega\\setminus\\mathrm{tr}(A),\\\\\n\\mathrm{tr}(A\\land B)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{tr}(A)\\cap\\mathrm{tr}(B),&\n\\mathrm{tr}(\\Box A)&\\coloneqq\\{n\\in\\omega\\mid\\forall j<n\\;j\\in\\mathrm{tr}(A)\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{FC}&\\coloneqq\\{(e,E)\\mid e\\in\\{0,1\\},\\ E\\subseteq\\omega,\\ \\exists m\\in\\omega\\ E\\subseteq m\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{den}(e,E)&\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}E,&e=0,\\\\\\omega\\setminus E,&e=1,\\end{cases}\n&\\neg_c(e,E)&\\coloneqq(1-e,E),\\\\\n(e,E)\\cap_c(f,D)&\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}(0,E\\cap D),&(e,f)=(0,0),\\\\(0,E\\setminus D),&(e,f)=(0,1),\\\\\n(0,D\\setminus E),&(e,f)=(1,0),\\\\(1,E\\cup D),&(e,f)=(1,1),\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mu(e,E)&\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\min(\\omega\\setminus E),&e=0,\\\\\\min E,&e=1\\land E\\ne\\varnothing,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\Box_c(e,E)&\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}(1,\\varnothing),&(e,E)=(1,\\varnothing),\\\\\n(0,\\{0,\\ldots,\\mu(e,E)\\}),&(e,E)\\ne(1,\\varnothing),\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{tc}(\\bot)&\\coloneqq(0,\\varnothing),&\\mathrm{tc}(\\neg A)&\\coloneqq\\neg_c\\mathrm{tc}(A),\\\\\n\\mathrm{tc}(A\\land B)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{tc}(A)\\cap_c\\mathrm{tc}(B),&\n\\mathrm{tc}(\\Box A)&\\coloneqq\\Box_c\\mathrm{tc}(A).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"e=0","display":false},{"tex":"e=1","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"(1,\\varnothing)","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"0,\\ldots,|E|","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"j<k","display":false},{"tex":"k+1","display":false},{"tex":"\\{0\\}","display":false}],"bytes":2778,"backlinks":[{"id":"0517fc365e0749bc","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"932deccafc8aeaa8","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"53fddde91ae3f682","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7a04766d8c28cddc","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-49","locations":["正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"[[89-df-letterless-trace]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-94","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-letterless-formula]] → [[89-df-finite-frame-rank]] → [[89-lem-finite-rank-successors]] → [[89-df-letterless-trace]] → [[89-lem-letterless-trace-code]] → [[89-thm-letterless-rank-trace]] → [[89-df-letterless-normal-form]] → [[89-thm-letterless-normal-form]] → [[89-cor-letterless-arithmetical-decision]]"}],"outgoing":["5d3ed6dcac828731"]}